Fact x Identified by Int
	Derived from (Foreach y: y.x1)
	Derived from (Foreach y: y.x2)
	Derived from (Foreach y: y.x3)
	Derived from (Foreach y: y.x4)
Fact y Identified by x1 * x2 * x3 * x4
	Derived from (Foreach x: y(x,x,x,x))
	Derived from (Foreach x1, x2, x3, x4:
		(y(x1, x2, x3, x4) Where Not(y(x2, x1, x4, x3)))
		Where x1 == x2 || x3 != x4
	)